        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olaiguanani Hesekia le Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiterua apa Hesekia aitoreisho aa o loo larin tikitam o imiet, neitoreisho ninye ilarin tikitam ooudo te Yerusalem. Ore apa enkarna e ng'otonye naa Abija entito e Sekaria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neas mbaa sidain te dukuya Olaitoriani, te risioroto e nena pooki apa naataasa papaai lenye Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore to lari le dukuya le nkitoria enye, to lapa le dukuya, nebol ninye nkutukie oo nkajijik e nkaji o Laitoriani, neram ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitijing'u ninye ilapolosak o Lawi, neiturrur ninche to lgoriet le nkalo oloo saen, nejoki ninye ninche, “Entoning'oki nanu lo Lawi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entisinya ate, nintisinyinyi enkaji o Laitoriani, Enkai oo loo papaai linyi, niwuang'ieng'ie intae olduruk teine wueji sinyati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu etaa apa iloo papa ilemeisiligayu, netaasa ninche entorroni too nkonyek o Laitoriani Enkai ang; etung'uitie ninche ninye, neibelekenyate aapaash emanyisho o Laitoriani, neisho ninche ninye oriong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiken sii kutukaji eine wueji sinyati, near iltaai, neitu epejoki enkorropil anaa eishooyo ilasarri teine wueji sinyati, aaisho Enkai e Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkaraki ina, nelotu engoro o Laitoriani napi shumata e Yuda o Yerusalem, neitaa ninche entoki naitureisho, o enenking'asia, o entoki naimakini, anaa enidolidolo too nkonyek inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ng'ura to lalem apa etabatatate loo papa o ilayiok lang, o ntoyie ang, ore nkituaak ang naatii netii atua eyararoto tenkaraki ena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etii naa taata oltau lai pee aitobir osotua lo lning'o o Laitoriani, Enkai e Israel, pee etum ina goro enye napi aibelekenyayu te iyiook. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kera aainei, emimenaa naa taata, amu etegelua intae Olaitoriani pee ipuopuo aaitashe te dukuya ninye, pee isiayiayia ninye, niakuku ilaisiaayiak lenyena nipejokiki ninye enkorropil.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki aadumunye kulikae Lawi, Mahat olayioni le Amasia, o Yoel olayioni le Asaria loo layiok le Kohat; ore too layiok le Merari naa Kish olayioni le Abdi, o Asaria olayioni le Yahalel; Ore too le Gershon, naa Yoa olayioni le Sima, o Eden olayioni le Yoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore too layiok le Elisafan, naa Shimri o Yeul; ore too layiok le Asaf naa Sekaria o Matania; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore too layiok le Heman, naa Yehuel o Shimei; ore too layiok le Yedutum naa Shimeia o Usiel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiturrur ninche ilalashera lenye neitisiny ate, nejing ninche atua anaa enaitanapishe olaiguanani, too rorei lo Laitoriani, pee eitisinyi enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuo ilapolosak olgilata liatua le nkaji o Laitoriani aaitisiny, neitayu ninche olduruk pooki, apa otii atua enkaji o Laitoriani aayau boo, ilo goriet le nkaji o Laitoriani, nedumu Ilawi aaya oerata le Kidron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiterutua apa ninche aaitisiny te nkolong e dukuya o lapa le dukuya, ore te nkolong e isiet o lapa nepuonu ninche olgoriet le kutukaji enkaji o Laitoriani; ore too nkolong'i isiet neitisiny ninche enkaji o Laitoriani ore te nkolong e tomon o ile o lapa le dukuya neidip ninche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Enyaakaki aaitisiny enkaji e Nkai neiteng'eli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ninche aapuo enetii olaiguanani Hesekia nejoki ninye, “Kintisinya iyiook enkaji o Laitoriani pooki, ilo perere lo lasar opejori o masaa enyena pooki, o ina mesa e mukate e nkitoduaaroto o masaa enyena pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore imasaa pooki apa naawa olaiguanani Ahas te nkitoria enye apa meisiligayu, nikintobira iyiook, nikintisinya; naa ng'ura etii ninche dukuya olperere lo lasar lo Laitoriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki olaiguanani Hesekia adumunye tadekenya neiturrur iltung'ana kituaak le nkanasa, neilep alo enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyau ninche iloing'ok oopishana, o lmeregeshi oopishana o lkuoo le kerra oopishana, tenkaraki olasar loo ng'ok o tenkaraki enkitoria, o tenkaraki ewueji sinyati o tenkaraki Yuda. Neitoki ninye aitanap ilapolosak lelo ayiok le Aron pee eishooyo ninche anaa olasar te nchumata olperere lo lasar lo Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyieng ninche lelo oing'ok, neng'amu ilapolosak osarge neisuaki olperere lo lasar; neyieng lelo meregeshi neisuaki osarge lenye olperere lo lasar; neyieng ilkuoo le kerra neisuaki osarge lenye olperere lo lasar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitokini aayau lelo kineji anaa olasar loo ng'ok, dukuya olaiguanani o eumata, neiteleiki ninche nkaik enye shumata ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyieng ilapolosak ninche neitobir olasar loo ng'ok to sarge le lelo kineji te nchumata olperere lo lasar, pee eitobir olning'o lo sotua tenkaraki Israel pooki. Amu eitanapishe olaiguanani nchere, ore olasar opejori, o lasar le ng'oki naa keitobiri tenkaraki Israel pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepik ninye Ilawi atua enkaji o Laitoriani, eeta nkinantani dapashi oo saanini, o Nkai oo sinkolioitin, o lwululi loo usin, te risioroto enkitanapata e Daudi, o ene Gad ilo aduaani lo laiguanani o Natan oloiboni le Nkai. Amu ore apa ina kitanapata naa Olaitoriani eing'uaa eimunye iloibonok lenyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitashe Ilawi eeta nena kinantani e Daudi neitashe ilapolosak eeta ntarumpetani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Hesekia aitanapisho pee eitobiri olasar opejori te nchumata olperere lo lasar. Ore ake pee eiteruni ilo perere lo lasar, neiteruni sii osinkolio oranyakini Olaitoriani, neitusuji eoshoto oo ntarumpetani, o nkinantani e Daudi ilo aiguanani le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neserem ina umata pooki, neranyisho ilaranyak, nebuaku ntarumpetani. Neranyisho nena pooki o metaba anaa neishunye ilo asar opejori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ake pee eidipayu olasar, neirrugo olaiguanani o lelo pooki ootii tenebo ninye aaserem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitanap olaiguanani Hesekia o lapolosak, o ltung'ana kituaak ilapolosak, metaranyaki Olaitoriani enkisisa too rorei le Daudi, o Asaf ilo aduaani. Nerany ninche enkisisa o Laitoriani te nchipai, neirrugo ninche aaserem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Hesekia ajo, “Intisinyakita taata intae ate Olaitoriani; entinyiku ene; niyauu ilasarri o nkishorot e nashe atua enkaji o Laitoriani.” Neyau ina umata ilasarri, o nkishorot e nashe, ore lelo pooki oota enyorrata too ltauja, neyau ilasarri oopejori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore esiana oo lasarri oopejori, ooyautua ina umata naa iloing'ok ntomoni naapishana, o lmeregeshi iip nabo, o lkuo le kerra iip are. Ore kulo pooki naa iloo lasarri oopejokini Olaitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore olasar lenkitisinyata naa iloing'ok iip ile o nkerra nkalifuni uni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake aikuti apa ilapolosak oleng nemeidim aaitobira ilasarri oopejori pooki, neaku eitisinya apa ilapolosak ate, neretu ninche ilalashera lenye, o metaba anaa neidipayu esiaai. Amu kedupa apa Ilawi too ltauja aalang ilapolosak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tenebo ilo asar opejori kitok, netii eilata o lasar le seriani, netii ilasarri oopikuni tenkaraki ilasarri oopejori. Neikoni neijia aarrinyu enkisiaayiare e nkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 29:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore Hesekia o ltung'ana pooki neshipayu tenkaraki ina naitaasa Olaitoriani iltung'ana; amu eewuo ina bae nabo kata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.29.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.29.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
